  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# Dr. Howard H.\n\n\n\n# Park\n\n\n\n###### DMD, MD\n\n\n\n### Training and Education\n\n\nResidency:\n\nUniversity of California, Los Angeles Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\n\nMedical School:\n\nUniversity of California, Los Angeles Doctorate of Medicine\n\nDental School:\n\nHarvard School of Dental Medicine Doctor of Dental Medicine\n\nDr. Park graduated with a Bachelors of Science degree in Information and Computer Science from the University of California, Irvine in 1987. He continued his education in dentistry at Harvard School of Dental Medicine. After receiving his Doctorate from Harvard, he began his residency training in oral and maxillofacial surgery at the University of California, Los Angeles during which he received his Medical Degree in 1995.\n\nDr. Park has been in private practice in Santa Monica and a member of the Medical Staff at Providence Saint John’s Health Center since 1999. He is also a member of the Medical Staff at UCLA, Ronald Reagan and on the teaching faculty at UCLA School of Dentistry in the Department of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery. Dr. Park maintains membership in several professional organizations including the American Association of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgeons, American Medical Association, and the Academy of Osseointegration. He is a Diplomate of the American Board of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery and practices the full scope of oral and maxillofacial surgery with special interest and expertise in dental implants.\n\n\n#### Dr. Richard H.\n\n\n\n#### Ting\n\n\n\n###### Dr. Richard H.\n\n\n\n###### Ting\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
